 "post": {
  "instagram": "The opening range breakout in 7 slides. Mark the high and low of the first 30 minutes, wait for a candle to close outside the range, put the stop back inside it (here the midpoint) and aim for 2× the risk. Example: entry 101.55, stop 100.60, target 103.45. And the day it fails: a 1R loss. Test any strategy on your own data before trading it.\n\nSave this for later and follow @calmedgeofficial for one trading concept a day.\n\nEducational example on an illustrative chart. Not financial advice; trading involves risk of loss.\n\n#openingrangebreakout #daytradingstrategy #orb #tradingeducation #technicalanalysis #daytrading #trading #learntotrade",
